Q: i am getting faces exception &quot;abc&quot; cannot be refrenced from zoo A: <p>The problem is that you are trying to update an element (<code>p:outputPanel</code>) which is embedded in another element (<code>p:tab</code>) with an id and of which the <code>p:tab</code> is embedded too in an <code>p:accordionPanel</code> with an id. You have to specify all the parents <code>id</code>s in the update attribute like below:</p>
<pre><code>  &lt;p:selectOneMenu id=&quot;zoo&quot; value=&quot;#{cc.attrs.bean.test}&quot; style=&quot;width:150px&quot;  label=&quot;#{hello.description}&quot; 
    converter=&quot;testConverter&quot;&gt;
         &lt;p:ajax event=&quot;change&quot; listener=&quot;#{cc.attrs.bean.onTest}&quot; update=&quot;xyz:hfg:abc&quot;/&gt;
         &lt;f:selectItems value=&quot;#{cc.attrs.bean.sooo}&quot; var=&quot;soh&quot; itemLabel=&quot;#{soh.ex1}&quot; itemValue=&quot;#{soh}&quot;/&gt;
  &lt;/p:selectOneMenu&gt;

  &lt;p:accordionPanel style=&quot;width:580px;&quot; id=&quot;xyz&quot;&gt;
  &lt;p:tab title=&quot;Test for tab&quot; id=&quot;hfg&quot;&gt;
    `enter code here`
    &lt;p:outputPanel style=&quot;width:525px;display:block&quot; id=&quot;abc&quot; &gt;    
    &lt;/p:outputPanel&gt;
  &lt;/p:tab&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>&lt;/p:accordionPanel&gt;</p>
<p>You should also put a space between the <code>title</code> and the id of your <code>p:tab</code> with <code>id=hfg</code>.</p>

Q: Showing decimal percentages in primefaces 5.1 pie chart A: <p>I finally added the javascript function below to my viewer.</p>

<pre><code>function ext() {
   this.cfg.seriesDefaults.rendererOptions.dataLabelFormatString = '%.4s%%';
   this.cfg.seriesDefaults.rendererOptions.dataLabelThreshold = 0;
}
</code></pre>

<p>In the backend (controller) I parsed the string setExtender of the model to the name of my javascript function. </p>

<pre><code>myPieChartModel.setExtender("ext");
</code></pre>
